  "note": "The tables of hacks built on the Complete FireRed Upgrade, such as Unbound and Radical Red. Each table is found through the FireRed code pointer the game reads it by, at the same offset in every CFRU ROM. The GF header at 0x100 points at the items (0x1C8), species (0x144) and abilities (0x1C0) too, but Radical Red 4.1 leaves its move names pointer (0x148) stale. FireRed's own item table is still at 0x3DB028 in both ROMs, and nothing points to it.",
  "kinds": {
    "item": {
      "length": 44,
      "note": "FireRed's item entry. Entries are keyed by their position in the table, which is the index a save stores: Unbound's index field differs from the position in 83 entries and Radical Red's in 3.",
      "ranges": [
        {"id": "name", "offset": "0x00", "length": 14, "type": "text-gen3-intl", "storage": "inline-or-pointer", "name": "Name", "confidence": "known", "source": "rom:b4776b82a4c7915d0fadeaa27e013523f99dfd94 and rom:964f951a0fdaf209e4ea1344883ef0d557bb3a80", "note": "Unbound keeps 33 long names behind a pointer. It also blanks four names, 54, 87, 175 and 186, with 0xFF as their first byte, so they read as empty."},
        {"id": "index", "offset": "0x0E", "length": 2, "type": "u16le", "name": "Index", "note": "Not the index a save stores, so it names no domain.", "confidence": "known", "source": "rom:b4776b82a4c7915d0fadeaa27e013523f99dfd94 and rom:964f951a0fdaf209e4ea1344883ef0d557bb3a80"},
        {"id": "description", "offset": "0x14", "length": 4, "type": "u32le", "name": "Description pointer", "confidence": "known", "source": "rom:b4776b82a4c7915d0fadeaa27e013523f99dfd94 and rom:964f951a0fdaf209e4ea1344883ef0d557bb3a80"},
        {"id": "pocket", "offset": "0x1A", "length": 1, "type": "u8", "pockets": {"1": "items", "2": "key-items", "3": "balls", "4": "tms", "5": "berries"}, "name": "Pocket", "confidence": "known", "source": "rom:b4776b82a4c7915d0fadeaa27e013523f99dfd94 and rom:964f951a0fdaf209e4ea1344883ef0d557bb3a80", "note": "Unbound's Enigma Berry, 175, has pocket 0, so it has no pocket."}
